WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:08,480
Even if you understand now, it's of no use anymore

2
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:12,134
Four corpses of nine-stage ferocious beasts

3
00:00:12,134 --> 00:00:16,600
It’s not really an unexpected gain.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:24,440
It's too risky

5
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:27,920
What do you want me to do if Yulin fails or breaks out?

6
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,770
Isn't this good?

7
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:33,370
Don't worry, if I really lose control, I'll have a lot of tricks up my sleeve to escape.

8
00:00:33,370 --> 00:00:41,260
I took out this psychic grass completely.

9
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:44,060
Leave it to you for safekeeping, and you can decide how to use it.

10
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:49,240
Okay, after you get out and practice the psychic pill, everyone’s skills will be upgraded two levels in a row.

11
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:51,360
Duanmu and the others can only last seven days after being poisoned.

12
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:54,440
After two days of going out, we only have four days left to explore.
